@startuml
title Sequence diagram: coordinator decides the request
hide footbox
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

' People work in the Web App, which calls the Backend API with their login token, so
' every call and its answer is two arrows: person <-> Web App, Web App <-> Backend API.
' Only the arrows to and from the Backend API and PostgreSQL are numbered, as in the
' draw.io and PDF versions.
' Approved: the coordinator accepts the request so planning can start. The event is
' confirmed later, after the Safety Review (the customer's "event approved").
' A request awaiting clarification can only be rejected, not approved.

actor "Event\nCoordinator" as coordinator
actor "Event\nOrganiser" as organiser
participant "Web App\n(React)" as web
participant "Backend API" as api
database "PostgreSQL" as db

== Coordinator decides the request (submitted or under review; a reason to reject) ==
alt Approved: the request may go on to planning
  coordinator -> web : Approve
  autonumber
  web -> api : POST /api/events/requests/:reference/decide
  api -> db : Status becomes approved,\nadd a decision entry
  api -> db : Save notification: organiser
  api --> web : The request, now approved
  autonumber stop
  web --> coordinator : Show the request
else Rejected: a reason is required
  coordinator -> web : Reject, with a reason
  autonumber resume
  web -> api : POST /api/events/requests/:reference/decide
  api -> db : Status becomes rejected, add\ndecision entry (with the reason)
  api -> db : Save notification: organiser,\nwith the reason
  api --> web : The request, now rejected
  autonumber stop
  web --> coordinator : Show the request
end

== Later, the Web App fetches the organiser's saved notifications (nothing is pushed) ==
organiser -> web : Open notifications
autonumber resume
web -> api : GET /api/notifications
api --> web : Your request was approved or rejected, with the reason
autonumber stop
web --> organiser : Show notifications

== Next: planning starts toward Confirmed (venues and equipment, Safety Review, then confirm) ==
@enduml
